Subject: [PATCH] restore original input initialization and canonical IRQ declarations

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Keep original pad constructors, declarations, manager initialization and action
table outside explicit diagnostics. Restore the original cPlatPad declaration.
Native SDK interrupt/context declarations come from the canonical host header; Wii
source numeric IDs and console declarations remain. Whole original input units
compile; real controller/KPAD/backend and complete game startup remain pending.

